--[[
    Seb's UI
    A generic, from-scratch Roblox UI library / visual shell.

    This file only builds LAYOUT AND COMPONENTS (window, collapsible
    categories, toggles, textboxes, buttons, sliders, keybind rows,
    dropdowns, a config save/load system, notifications, and a
    local-player identity header).

    It does not contain any game logic, remote calls, movement changes,
    or anything else — every interactive element just exposes an
    `.Event` you connect to. What you do inside that callback (in your
    own script, for your own game) is entirely up to you.
]]

